docs {
  # Batch Confirm Presigned Uploads (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch/confirm-upload`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Confirms multiple direct client uploads. Verifies each object in storage, queries file sizes and ETags, and inserts all records in PostgreSQL.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `items` | `array` | Yes | Array of confirm upload requests (max 50) |
  | `items[].object_key` | `string` | Yes | RustFS object key received during presign |
  | `items[].original_filename` | `string` | Yes | Original file name |
  | `items[].type` | `string` | Yes | Attachment type |
  | `items[].group_id` | `int64` | No | Associated squad/group ID |
  | `items[].expense_id` | `int64` | No | Associated expense ID |
  | `items[].is_public` | `boolean` | No | Whether the file is public |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "object_key": "raw-key.jpg",
          "original_filename": "photo.jpg",
          "type": "GALLERY_IMAGE",
          "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:00Z"
        }
      ],
      "total": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Empty items list or exceeds maximum limit of 50 items
  * `401 Unauthorized` — Missing or invalid token
  * `404 Not Found` — One or more objects not found in storage
}
